node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
.env
.DS_Store

# Generated image derivatives — masters live in assets/images/
# Rebuild with: npm run images
#
# Every format the pipeline emits must be listed. AVIF was added in ASP-47
# and this line with it: without it, 105 generated files (~5MB) would have
# been committed, which is the stale-artefact problem the rest of this
# section exists to prevent.
public/images/*.avif
public/images/*.webp
public/images/*.jpg

# The generated vCard artefacts were ignored here until ASP-51 removed the
# feature. Nothing produces a .vcf or a QR any more, so the rules went with
# the generator rather than lingering as instructions for a build step that
# no longer exists.
